---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ContactSection from '../components/ContactSection.astro';
import LicensedImage from '../components/primitives/LicensedImage.astro';
import { rickenbackerModels, rickenbackerGuideSlug } from '../data/rickenbacker-models';
import { rickenbackerPhotoSets } from '../data/rickenbacker-model-photos';
import { resolveImage,assetSrc,ogCardSize } from '../lib/images';
import { SITE_URL } from '../config/site';
import '../styles/rickenbacker-models.css';
const path='/rickenbacker-authentication-and-value-guides/';
const title='Rickenbacker Authentication And Value Guides';
const description='Photo guides to vintage Rickenbacker guitars, basses and lap steels. Identify models, inspect originality and repairs, and review Joe’s estimated value charts.';
const hero=rickenbackerPhotoSets['360'][0].file;
const schema={'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'CollectionPage',name:title,description,url:SITE_URL+path,mainEntity:{'@type':'ItemList',itemListElement:rickenbackerModels.flatMap((m,i)=>['authentication','value'].map((kind,j)=>({'@type':'ListItem',position:i*2+j+1,name:`Rickenbacker ${m.name} ${kind==='value'?'Value':'Authentication'} Guide`,url:SITE_URL+'/post/'+rickenbackerGuideSlug(m,kind as 'authentication'|'value')+'/'})))}};
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={path} ogImage={SITE_URL+assetSrc(hero)} {...ogCardSize(hero)} structuredData={[schema]} bodyClass="rickenbacker-model-index">
 <div class="ric-model">
  <nav class="ric-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/blog/">Blog</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>Rickenbacker Model Guides</span></nav>
  <header class="ric-hub-intro"><p class="ric-eyebrow">Joe’s Vintage Guitars Reference Library</p><h1>Rickenbacker Authentication And Value Guides</h1><p>Find your model family, then use the authentication guide to check its identity and condition. The paired value guide provides Joe’s estimated market values in USD by model and production period, with notes on the condition details that affect price. Start with the <a href="/rickenbacker-serial-numbers/">Rickenbacker serial lookup</a> if you have a number but do not yet know the year.</p><p>These guides cover the major vintage guitar, bass and lap-steel families, with related variants grouped together. Later reissues are identified separately. Photos come from Joe’s archive; captions name the instrument actually shown, including related-model comparisons.</p><nav class="ric-resource-links" aria-label="Model Families"><a href="#guitars">Guitars</a><a href="#basses">Basses</a><a href="#lap-steels">Lap Steels</a><a href="#using-the-guides">How To Use These Guides</a></nav></header>
  {(['Guitars','Basses','Lap Steels'] as const).map(group=><section class="ric-hub-group" id={group.toLowerCase().replaceAll(' ','-')}><h2>{group}</h2><div class="ric-hub-cards">{rickenbackerModels.filter(m=>m.group===group).map(m=>{const p=rickenbackerPhotoSets[m.photoSet][0];const src=resolveImage(p.file);if(!src)throw new Error(p.file);return <article class="ric-hub-card"><LicensedImage src={src} alt={p.alt} caption={p.caption} width={600} loading="lazy"/><div><p class="ric-eyebrow">{m.period}</p><h3>{m.name}</h3><small>{p.caption}</small><nav aria-label={`${m.name} Guides`}><a href={`/post/${rickenbackerGuideSlug(m,'authentication')}/`}>Authentication Guide</a><a href={`/post/${rickenbackerGuideSlug(m,'value')}/`}>Value Guide</a></nav></div></article>})}</div></section>)}
  <section class="ric-hub-footer" id="using-the-guides"><h2>How To Use These Guides</h2><p>Identify the model and manufacturing era before choosing a price comparison. A reissue’s historical suffix is not its production date, and a serial stamped on a replaceable part cannot authenticate the rest of the instrument. Compare several construction details and document repairs.</p><p>Value charts show Joe’s estimated market ranges for excellent, original instruments, with the original case where applicable. Match the model, years and configuration before using a row. Repairs, modifications and uncertain identity need an individual appraisal; market estimates are different from purchase offers.</p><h3>Need A Closer Look At A Part?</h3><nav class="ric-resource-links" aria-label="Hardware Guides"><a href="/rickenbacker-pickup-dating-guide/">Pickups</a><a href="/rickenbacker-tuner-dating-guide/">Tuners</a><a href="/rickenbacker-knobs-and-controls/">Controls</a><a href="/rickenbacker-body-binding-and-inlays/">Body, Binding And Inlays</a><a href="/rickenbacker-tailpiece-dating-guide/">Tailpieces</a><a href="/rickenbacker-finish-colors/">Finish Colors</a></nav><div class="ric-appraisal"><h3>Send Joe Your Rickenbacker Photos</h3><p>If the model is still uncertain, send the full front and back, headstock, serial, hardware and any known repairs. You can request an appraisal or discuss selling without taking the instrument apart.</p><div class="ric-actions"><a class="ric-button" href="/free-appraisal/">Get A Free Appraisal</a><a href="/sell-my-rickenbacker-guitar/">Sell My Rickenbacker</a></div></div></section>
 </div><ContactSection/>
</Layout>
